\item \strong{macOS}: \verb{/Applications/Google Chrome.app/Contents/MacOS/Google Chrome}
and \verb{/Applications/Chromium.app/Contents/MacOS/Chromium}.
\item \strong{Windows}: the \code{chrome.exe} install locations under \verb{Program Files}
and \verb{Program Files (x86)}, as well as a per-user AppData install
